§ `Sections 672.87 to 672.89 -- Delivery and detention; Review Board of receiving province; other interprovincial transfers`

-- 672.87: a warrant described in subsection 672.86(2) is sufficient authority (a) for any person who is responsible for the custody of an accused to have the accused taken into custody and conveyed to the person in charge of the place specified in the warrant;
-- and (b) for the person specified in the warrant to detain the accused in accordance with any disposition made in respect of the accused under paragraph 672.54(c).
-- src:14019 | Delivery and detention of accused
-- src:14020 | 672.87 A warrant described in subsection 672.86(2) is sufficient authority
-- src:14021 | (a) for any person who is responsible for the custody of an accused to have the accused taken into custody and conveyed to the person in charge of the place specified in the warrant; and
-- src:14022 | (b) for the person specified in the warrant to detain the accused in accordance with any disposition made in respect of the accused under paragraph 672.54(c).
@ref s 672.87; s 672.87(a); s 672.87(b) (src:14019-14022)
GIVEN `it is a warrant described in subsection 672.86(2)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person is responsible for the custody of the accused` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 672.87(a) the warrant is sufficient authority for the person responsible for the custody of the accused to have the accused taken into custody and conveyed to the person in charge of the place specified in the warrant` MEANS
    IF `it is a warrant described in subsection 672.86(2)` AND `the person is responsible for the custody of the accused`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "A warrant described in subsection 672.86(2) is sufficient authority (a) for any person who is responsible for the custody of an accused"

@ref s 672.87(b) (src:14019-14022)
GIVEN `it is a warrant described in subsection 672.86(2)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person is the person specified in the warrant` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the detention is in accordance with a disposition made in respect of the accused under paragraph 672.54(c)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 672.87(b) the warrant is sufficient authority for the person specified in the warrant to detain the accused` MEANS
    IF `it is a warrant described in subsection 672.86(2)` AND `the person is the person specified in the warrant` AND `the detention is in accordance with a disposition made in respect of the accused under paragraph 672.54(c)`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "for the person specified in the warrant to detain the accused in accordance with any disposition made in respect of the accused under paragraph 672.54(c)"

